# SwiftFormat configuration (nicklockwood/SwiftFormat).
# Kept deliberately close to defaults: the value is consistency, not cleverness.
--swiftversion 5.10
--maxwidth 120
--indent 4
# Leave multiline string interiors alone — legal text and reason templates
# are content, not code; reindenting them changes the rendered text.
--indentstrings false
--exclude Packages/MunchKit/.build
